[{"title":"舍身台","author":"王世贞","text":"般若何曾有此因，如来偶醒恋身人。\n黄金台上高千尺，天下谁人不舍身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43182,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"献花岩","author":"王世贞","text":"自从偷破信师缄，百卉虽繁鸟不衔。\n无奈儿孙诽祖失，至今犹号献花岩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43183,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"懒融洞","author":"王世贞","text":"雪里垂垂长白莲，不言不起更悠然。\n汝家初祖曾何道，翻结神天有漏缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43184,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宗人光禄华松鸿胪王继山邀余于王贡士园看牡丹后复同光禄看芍药戏成一绝","author":"王世贞","text":"坐深那论主和宾，总是乌衣巷里人。\n差胜红丹与白药，一般花蒂两番春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43185,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵人家门多种树树头巢乌噪不止甚厌之戏为一绝","author":"王世贞","text":"吴门旧曲厌乌栖，又听长干乌夜啼。\n丈人屋头有何好，不如清晓汝南鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43186,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊子初中夏金陵祈晴祈雨者各一而大宗伯姜公主之应因呈公一绝","author":"王世贞","text":"禾田宜雨麦宜晴，前后青泥叩玉清。\n姜氏重瞻灌坛令，秣陵初遇束长生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43187,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大